<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34606" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pĕr-ăcūtus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>very sharp.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">falx,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					3, 24, 5</span></i>
			 (dub.).—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, of sound, <i>very
				clear</i> or <i>penetrating</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vox,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Brut. 68, 241</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, 
			
			<i>very keen</i>, <i>very acute</i>, <i>very penetrating</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cum peracutus esset ad excogitandum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Brut. 39, 145</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">oratio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 76, 264</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Verr. 2, 2, 44, §
				108</span></i>.—<i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pĕrăcūtē</span></b> , <i>very sharply</i>, <i>very
			acutely</i>, <i>with great keenness</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">moveri,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Ac. 1, 9, 35</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">peracute querebare, quod, etc.,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Fam. 3, 7, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">reperisse,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. Mag. 34</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
